{'symbol': 'AXP', 'date': '2022-01-27 09:30:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN EXPRESS DECLARES DIVIDEND ON SERIES D PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY (NYSE:AXP) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S 3.550% FIXED RATE RESET NONCUMULATIVE PREFERRED SHARES, SERIES D, OF $8,875 PER SHARE (WHICH IS EQUIVALENT TO $8.87500 PER RELATED DEPOSITARY SHARE). THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON MARCH 15, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON MARCH 1, 2022. ABOUT AMERICAN EXPRESS AMERICAN EXPRESS IS A GLOBALLY INTEGRATED PAYMENTS COMPANY, PROVIDING CUSTOMERS WITH ACCESS TO PRODUCTS, INSIGHTS AND EXPERIENCES"}